---
import DownloadButton from "./DownloadButton.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="container mx-auto py-16 px-4">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-start">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-white">
      About
    </h2>

    <p class="text-xl font-light text-[#8c8c8c] leading-relaxed">
      Full Stack Developer with professional experience building and maintaining <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">PHP</span> and <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">JavaScript</span> web applications, developing custom <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">Laravel</span> middleware, and crafting robust <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">WordPress</span> implementations.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xl font-light text-[#8c8c8c] leading-relaxed">
      I have engineered media-management tooling for platforms with over <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">8,000+ images</span>, resolved complex vulnerabilities, and boosted accessibility and Lighthouse performance across high-traffic client platforms using tools like <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">React</span>, <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">Docker</span>, and <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">SQL</span>.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xl font-light text-[#8c8c8c] leading-relaxed">
      With a background ranked in the <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">top 2% of testers</span> on Applause and experience as a <span class="text-[#F8F8F8]">Team Test Lead</span>, I approach development with a rigorous focus on code quality, security hardening, and real-world stability.
    </p>

    <DownloadButton
      href="/alessio_pinto_cv.pdf"
      label="Download resume"
    />
  </div>
</section>
